  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">일주일동안 학생들이랑 즐겁게 야외수업하고, 다음 주에 답을 알려줘야하는데 화강암과 편마암을 제외하고는 확신이 안 서서 선생님들 고견을 여쭤보려고 합니다…!<br><br>비전공자라 구분하는데 한계가 있어서요..<br>미리 답변 감사합니다 &#129392;\n<br><br>\n1. </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc83dd2ab76cd2a2dc2e871e873eb05c2a079a9e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc83dd2ab76cd2a2dc2e871e873eb05c2a079a9e\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"440\"><div class=\"figcaption\">1.</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5c2145c4295c8bedd808e04f9c3681b10d790063\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5c2145c4295c8bedd808e04f9c3681b10d790063\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"533\"><div class=\"figcaption\">2.</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">3.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c3b09ed33d488a83c1880d67565d2c7f60219e62\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c3b09ed33d488a83c1880d67565d2c7f60219e62\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"542\"><div class=\"figcaption\">3.</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">4.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/867307ee7e425cde1cfca75432d7c115fde40cf4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/867307ee7e425cde1cfca75432d7c115fde40cf4\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"422\"><div class=\"figcaption\">4.</div></div>